This project is an independent capability port of oh-my-openagent (OmO) v4.19.4
for Qoder.

Upstream: https://github.com/code-yeongyu/oh-my-openagent
Upstream tag: v4.19.4
Upstream commit: b072d279110bdda2c6ac2525d0d24dc54d16148a
Upstream license: Sustainable Use License 1.0 (not an OSI license)

No upstream source code is copied into this repository. The port re-derives
protocols from public documentation and observed behavior. The capability
mapping, gaps, and selective-sync policy are recorded in docs/PARITY.md and
upstream/omo-sources.lock.json.
